# Event-Driven Architecture

## Event Types

| Type | Base | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Domain Event | `IDomainEvent` | In-process, same transaction |
| Integration Event | `IntegrationEventBase` | Cross-module, via outbox → RabbitMQ |

## Integration Event Base

```csharp
public abstract record IntegrationEventBase : IDomainEvent
{
    public Guid EventId { get; init; } = Guid.NewGuid();
    public Guid TenantId { get; init; }
    public DateTime OccurredAt { get; init; } = DateTime.UtcNow;
}
```

## Publishing (in command handler)

```csharp
student.AddDomainEvent(new StudentAdmittedIntegrationEvent(student.Id, student.TenantId));
// Outbox interceptor captures on SaveChanges
```

## Consuming

```csharp
public class StudentAdmittedNotificationHandler 
    : IEventHandler<StudentAdmittedIntegrationEvent>
{
    public async Task Handle(StudentAdmittedIntegrationEvent evt, CancellationToken ct) { }
}
```

## Rules

- Handlers must be **idempotent** — check `ProcessedEvents` table by `EventId`
- Handlers must NOT call `SaveChanges` on another module's DbContext directly
- Failed handlers: retry 3x → dead letter queue
- Never publish integration events before DB commit (outbox guarantees this)

## MVP Events by Module

| Module | Events |
|---|---|
| Identity | `UserRegistered`, `PasswordResetRequested`, `UserLocked` |
| Institution | `TenantCreated`, `AcademicYearChanged` |
| Students | `StudentAdmitted`, `StudentWithdrawn`, `GuardianLinked` |
| Attendance | `AttendanceMarked`, `AttendanceEdited` |
| Fees | `FeeInvoiceGenerated`, `FeePaymentReceived`, `FeeOverdue` |
| RBAC | `RolePermissionsChanged`, `UserRoleAssigned` |
